# A5 headed receipt. The live shell starts from its Frisket payload, promotes
# the primary space at the first float, and then projects the same PaneId
# through the primary compositor and a lens window. Float station geometry is
# intentionally transient until A8 replaces the legacy frame sidecar.
settle 30
key escape

open mere://a5-floating-proof
settle 5
act Open Roster pane
act Open Gloss pane
settle 5
assert pane roster
assert pane gloss

# Gloss leaves a nested tiled tree for the float layer. The capture is the
# pixel half; the snapshot and event are the app-truth half.
act Float pane
settle 5
assert event pane-floated gloss
assert snap floats ~ gloss
capture 01_gloss_float

# Float Roster into the other default station, then click Gloss itself. The
# click raises Gloss through the same hit-test/z-order path the desktop uses.
click-at 800 450
act Float pane
settle 5
assert snap floats ~ roster
click-at 800 100
settle 5
assert snap floats == roster,gloss
capture 02_gloss_raised

# Dock Roster, then dock Gloss beside the graph branch. The retained Gloss
# runner keeps the same PaneId while the blueprint becomes a nested split.
click-at 180 140
act Dock pane
settle 5
assert event pane-docked roster
click-at 800 100
act Dock pane
settle 5
assert event pane-docked gloss
capture 03_gloss_docked_nested

# Tear out FROM the float: the destination lens receives the same relative
# rectangle and retained renderer key, not a newly summoned Gloss pane.
act Float pane
settle 5
assert snap floats ~ gloss
act Tear out pane
settle 30
assert windows == 2
assert event pane-torn-out gloss
assert no-pane gloss
assert lens-pane 0:gloss
assert snap lens-floats ~ 0:gloss
capture 04_primary_after_tearout
capture-lens 05_gloss_float_in_lens

# Return preserves the floating station, then dock once more to leave a
# reachable tiled pane in the primary window.
act Return pane to primary
settle 10
assert event pane-returned gloss
assert pane gloss
assert snap floats ~ gloss
capture 06_gloss_returned_float
act Dock pane
settle 5
assert event pane-docked gloss
capture 07_gloss_returned_docked

log A5 floating pane desktop receipt complete
